{"title":"隐私政策","path":"/privacy-policy","wpSlug":"privacy-policy","capturedAt":"2026-08-11","blocks":[{"type":"heading","text":"隐私政策 Privacy Policy"},{"type":"heading","text":"前言 Introduction"},{"type":"heading","text":"感谢您使用我们的数易数字人生软件/网页（以下简称“服务”）。我们深知个人隐私对您的重要性，并致力于保护您的个人信息。本隐私协议（以下简称“协议”）旨在向您阐述在您使用服务过程中，我们如何收集、使用、披露和保护您的个人信息。请您在使用服务前仔细阅读本协议，确保您充分理解和同意我们的隐私保护措施。"},{"type":"heading","text":"Thank you for using the Shuyi Digital Life software/website (hereinafter referred to as the \"Service\"). We value the importance of your personal privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy (hereinafter referred to as the \"Policy\") explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your personal information when you use our Service. Please read this Policy carefully before using the Service to ensure that you fully understand and agree to our privacy protection measures."},{"type":"heading","text":"我们收集的信息 Information We Collect"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1. 个人信息 Personal Information 当您使用我们的服务时，我们可能会收集您的个人信息，包括但不限于： – 注册信息： 姓名、出生日期、性别、联系方式等。 – 使用信息： 您使用服务时产生的信息，例如您的设备信息、IP地址、浏览记录等。 When you use our Service, we may collect the following personal information, including but not limited to: – Registration information: name, date of birth, gender, contact details, etc. – Usage information: data generated during your use of the Service, such as device information, IP address, and browsing history. 2. 非个人信息 Non-Personal Information 我们还可能收集非个人信息，例如设备型号、操作系统版本、浏览器类型等。这些信息无法直接识别您的个人身份。 另外，我们无权限获取您的测算信息，若有任何数据丢失，我们无法恢复相关数据。 We may also collect non-personal information, such as device model, operating system version, and browser type. Such information does not directly identify your personal identity. Additionally, we do not have access to your fortune-calculation results; therefore, in the event of data loss, we are unable to restore such data."},{"type":"heading","text":"我们如何使用您的信息 How We Use Your Information"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"提供服务 Providing Services ： 根据您提供的信息为您进行数字人生测算、算命、占卜等服务。 改善服务 Improving Services ： 分析您的使用情况和反馈，改进我们的服务质量和用户体验。 个性化推荐 Personalization ： 根据您的兴趣和偏好，向您推荐相关内容和服务。 营销推广 Marketing & Promotions ： 在您同意的情况下，向您发送有关我们服务的最新资讯、优惠活动等信息。 法律义务 Legal Compliance ： 遵守适用的法律法规和监管要求。"},{"type":"heading","text":"我们如何披露您的信息 How We Disclose Your Information"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第三方服务提供商 Third-Party Service Providers ： 我们可能会与第三方服务提供商共享您的信息，以便他们为我们提供技术支持、数据分析、营销推广等服务。 法律义务 Legal Obligations ： 在法律法规要求或政府部门要求的情况下，我们可能会披露您的信息。 合并、收购等 Business Transactions ： 如果我们涉及合并、收购或破产等情况，您的信息可能会转移给相关第三方。"},{"type":"heading","text":"我们如何保护您的信息 How We Protect Your Information"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我们采取合理且必要的技术和管理措施，防止您的信息遭到未经授权的访问、使用、披露、更改或破坏。例如： 数据加密与存储保护 严格的访问权限控制 定期的安全监测与漏洞修复 We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your information against unauthorized access, use, disclosure, alteration, or destruction. For example: Encryption and secure storage of data Strict access control measures Regular security monitoring and vulnerability patching"},{"type":"heading","text":"您的权利 Your Rights"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"根据适用的法律，您享有以下权利： 访问和更正：您可以访问或修改您的个人信息。 删除权：在符合法律要求的情况下，您可以请求删除您的个人信息。 撤回同意：您有权随时撤回对某些信息处理的同意。 Under applicable laws, you have the following rights: Access and Correction: You may access or correct your personal information. Right to Deletion: You may request deletion of your personal information under certain legal conditions. Withdrawal of Consent: You may withdraw your consent to certain processing activities at any time."},{"type":"heading","text":"政策更新 Policy Updates"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我们可能会根据法律法规或服务需求，不时更新本隐私政策。更新后的内容将通过适当方式通知您，并自发布之日起生效。 We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time in accordance with legal or service requirements. Updated versions will be communicated to you through appropriate means and will take effect from the date of publication."},{"type":"heading","text":"联系我们 Contact Us"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"如果您对本隐私政策或个人信息的处理有任何疑问，请通过以下方式联系我们： 电子邮箱：shuyi.fn@gmail.com If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our handling of your personal information, please contact us at: Email: shuyi.fn@gmail.com"}]}